  "incidents) under custom module personas, presented the way an 8.0 box presents",
  "them (`assistant_personas` module first, Key Store behind it). Every other sweep",
  "row runs either the built-in Agentic assistant or a ZTP persona; nothing covered a",
  "custom persona doing everyday record work. Values are invented; no box data.",
  "Allowlists deliberately name RETIRED tools (find_record_actions, healthcheck_connector)",
  "the way a persona written before a consolidation would -- they must still resolve."
